In the recent YAAP (samurai) I thought that the next ascension would be a
rogue. As you see, it wasn't. I started this game six days after the
previous ascension and ascended yesterday, first of august.

I guess the turning point in this game was the Gnomish mines, where
polymorph trap gave me two nice pets; Lissu the arch-lich and Ellu the
earth elemental. Sokoban gave me the amulet, which also saved my life a
couple of times.

The Quest I really liked, it was somehow much more fun than all the others
I've done. Although I didn't have magic resistance before obtaining the
PYEC, and AC of only -4 or so, there wasn't big problems. Lissu and Ellu
were nice things to have :-)

Found the castle's tune by trying, emptied the castle with Magicbane (or
was it Fire Brand?) and a silver saber.

Since there was a silver dragon guarding the armoury, the first wish went
for =Lev. The dragon left scales and after the second attempt I managed to
convert the scales to an armour. Now you ask 'What second attempt? The
enchant armour scroll works on the first try..'. Well, I remembered wrong,
and confused my self before reading the scroll..

The Valley of the Dead gave me another /oW, which I really didn't need.  I
vapourised my silver saber, when tried to enchant it from +6... Lesson
learned.

Mind flayers ate my brains twice, but didn't even thought of genociding
them, or any one else for that matter.

As usual, Vlad was a pushover. The demonlords asked some money for safe
passage, I offered 1 zorkmid, and they all died. VS was on level 47 or
49. First time ever Rodney wasn't waiting me in Sanctum, and he appeared
only once in Gehennom and in the Plane of Earth.


The Elemental Planes went quite fast, even though the portal on Air was far
away. /Poly makes wonders: "You break out of the human zombie!" :-)

On Astral the middle altar was guarded by Famine and was lawful. On left I
faced Death and Death's face met !Paralysis. The altar was my own so:

